msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_TODO_00:1"
msgid "<if ($n4 == 16)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Mine splendid slate in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the splendid slate to Qhoterl Pasol</if><else><if ($n4 == 17)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Gather splendid water ivy in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the splendid water ivy to Qhoterl Pasol</if><else><if ($n4 == 18)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Catch a splendid eryops at Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the splendid eryops to Qhoterl Pasol</if></if></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 探索と発掘は、腰を据えてやらねばならない大事業～。<br>当然、このホパル古盤に長期滞在することになりまする～。<br>ですから、拠点の整備は必須と言えましょ～！
#. de: Puh, Ausgrabungen sind ganz schön anstrengend. Dafür müssen Grabende Pfoten ausgeruht und fit sein. Deshalb muss Lager gut ausgestattet sein.
#. fr: Explorer et excaver être santé, mais aussi faire gros bobo partouuut<nbsp>! Qitari avoir besoin d'entretenir lieu de vie pour pouuuvoir se reposer quand grosse grosse fatigue poindre bout de son nez.
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_000:1"
msgid "Ours is a large undertaking, and we expect to be hunkered down here for a good long while. That being the case, I've a mind to add some creature comforts to the Stopple."
msgstr ""

#. ja: というわけで今回、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>殿には、<br>拠点整備に最適な素材の調達を、お願いいたしまする～。
#. de: Kannst du bitte Material für Ausbau von Lager besorgen, ja?
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> ramener nécessaire pour aider Qitari à maintenir lieu de vie en bon état, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_002:1"
msgid "<if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, I'd be in your debt if you could procure a few things to help me make this place a home away from home."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほしいのは、「<sheet Item 29519 0>」～。<br>トゥシ・メキタ湖で採れるこれを3つ、<br>調達してきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend drei <noun-de Item 5 29519 2 4 1>. Findest du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta.
#. fr: Toi extraire trois <noun-fr Item 12 29519 2 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_010:1"
msgid "Specifically, I require three slabs of slate. These can be had in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta. Many thanks, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, and happy digging!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほしいのは、「<sheet Item 29545 0>」～。<br>トゥシ・メキタ湖で採れるこれを3つ、<br>調達してきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend drei <noun-de Item 5 29545 2 4 1>. Findest du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta.
#. fr: Toi récolter trois <noun-fr Item 12 29545 2 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_020:1"
msgid "Specifically, I require three lengths of water ivy. These can be had in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta. Many thanks, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, and happy gathering!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほしいのは、「<sheet Item 29571 0>」～。<br>トゥシ・メキタ湖で<sheet Item 27582 0>を餌にして、<br>釣ってきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend <noun-de Item 5 29571 1 4 1>. Kannst du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta mit <noun-de Item 5 27582 1 3 1> fangen.
#. fr: Toi utiliser <noun-fr Item 12 27582 1 1> pour pêcher <noun-fr Item 12 29571 1 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_030:1"
msgid "Specifically, I require an eryops. They dwell in the waters of Lake Tusi Mek'ta, and are passing fond of fruit worms. Many thanks, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, and happy fishing!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: トゥシ・メキタ湖で採れる、<br>「<sheet Item 29519 0>」を3つ、<br>調達してきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend drei <noun-de Item 5 29519 2 4 1>. Findest du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta.
#. fr: Toi extraire trois <noun-fr Item 12 29519 2 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_100_010:1"
msgid "While there's no avoiding getting a little wet, the slate ought not pose you too much trouble. I await your return with bated breath!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: トゥシ・メキタ湖で採れる、<br>「<sheet Item 29545 0>」を3つ、<br>調達してきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend drei <noun-de Item 5 29545 2 4 1>. Findest du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta.
#. fr: Toi récolter trois <noun-fr Item 12 29545 2 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_100_020:1"
msgid "While there's no avoiding getting a little wet, the water ivy ought not pose you too much trouble. I await your return with bated breath!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Item 27582 0>を餌に、トゥシ・メキタ湖で、<br>「<sheet Item 29571 0>」を、<br>釣ってきてくださいましな～。
#. de: Brauchen dringend <noun-de Item 5 29571 1 4 1>. Kannst du sicher im Schlangensee Tusi Mek'ta mit <noun-de Item 5 27582 1 3 1> fangen.
#. fr: Toi utiliser <noun-fr Item 12 27582 1 1> pour pêcher <noun-fr Item 12 29571 1 1> que toi trouver dans lac Tusi Mek'ta. Profond profond<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_100_030:1"
msgid "So long as you use fruit worms as bait, the eryops ought not pose you too much trouble. I await your return with bated breath!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: さてさて、拠点整備用の素材は集まりましたでしょか～？
#. de: Sobald du Ware bringst, können Grabende Pfoten Lager weiter ausbauen.
#. fr: Qhoterl Pasol très fatiguée... Besoin de nécessaire pour entretien du lit<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_040:1"
msgid "Ah, there you are, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. May I ask if you have that which I requested?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おぉ、希望どおりの品でございまする～。<br>さすがは<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>殿～！
#. de: Ah, genau richtig! Vielen Dank, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Magnifique<nbsp>! Grâce à toi, Qitari pouuuvoir faire gros dodo réparateur<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_050:1"
msgid "Yes, this is absolutely splendid! My gratitude!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これで拠点の住み心地が良くなれば、<br>それだけ身体が休まって、作業効率も増すというもの～。<br>夫たちには、もっとも～っと働いてもらいましょ～！
#. de: Je gemütlicher und praktischer Lager wird, desto besser können sich Grabende Pfoten erholen und noch tiefer graben!
#. fr: Et plus dodo être réparateuuur, plus productivité monter en flèche<nbsp>! Nos maris plus avoir excuse pour tirer au flanc<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq103_03808:TEXT_BANQIQ103_03808_QHOTERLPASOL_000_051:1"
msgid "By making the Stopple more comfortable, our workers will be better rested. And a rested worker is a <i>productive</i> worker! Oh yes, perhaps we can look into extending the length of shifts..."
msgstr ""
